ServiceCall ..> Team : <<use>>
ServiceCall ..> Hackathon : <<use>>
ServiceCall ..> Incarico : <<use>>
ServiceCall ..> CalendarGateway : <<use>>
ServiceCall ..> ServiceNotifiche : <<use>>
ServicePagamento ..> Pagamento : <<use>>
ServicePagamento ..> Hackathon : <<use>>
ServicePagamento ..> Team : <<use>>
ServicePagamento ..> PaymentGateway : <<use>>
ServiceSegnalazione ..> Segnalazione : <<use>>
